NOTE ON DEPENDENCIES / 依赖的许可证提醒

This MIT license covers ONLY the source code in this repository.

chordsheet depends on madmom at runtime. madmom's source code is BSD-licensed,
but its bundled pre-trained model files are licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0),
which prohibits commercial use.

This repository does not redistribute those model files — they are installed
with madmom. But anyone running this pipeline is using them, and is therefore
bound by CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for the beat, downbeat and chord stages.

本仓库的 MIT 许可证只覆盖这里的源代码。chordsheet 运行时依赖 madmom，
madmom 的代码是 BSD，但它捆绑的预训练模型是 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，**禁止商用**。
本仓库不重新分发这些模型文件，但任何运行本流水线的人都在使用它们，
因而受该协议约束。商用前请自行确认。
